   "alt": "The great weighing hall of the market, painted in ink and gouache: an open arched gateway on the left leads back to the market square; six coloured doors stand side by side in the back wall: red, yellow and green arched doors, then blue, purple and teal doors. A boy cuts a pie into equal portions, mice carry slices of cake, a baker holds a heavy mass of dough beside a brass balance, a hundred balloons float up, a mouse stands beside a whole cheese with a teacup on top, a girl checks her spirit level on her knee, a dog sleeps on the leftover bread, a thermometer climbs in grey steam, a boy cheers at a jar of marbles, a mouse hugs one piece of cheese, a chef counts on his fingers and a girl cuts an apple in half.",
